# Same list as the repo-root .prettierignore, and it has to be stated twice
# because the two prettier invocations this repo makes have different working
# directories and Prettier 3 resolves the ignore file against the CWD only --
# it does not walk up to the repository root.
#
#   pre-commit  .husky/pre-commit -> npx lint-staged, CWD = repo root
#               -> reads /.prettierignore
#   CI + local  npm run format / format:write, CWD = apps/api (npm runs a
#               workspace script inside the workspace, and CI's api job also
#               sets defaults.run.working-directory: apps/api)
#               -> reads apps/api/.prettierignore, this file
#
# Config resolution is the opposite, which is what made this surprising:
# `prettier --find-config-path src/index.ts` from apps/api answers
# ../../prettier.config.cjs, because config lookup walks up from each file
# while ignore lookup does not walk up from the CWD.
#
# With only the root file, `cd apps/api && npm run format` listed both
# golden.treat-nmd*.json and exited 1, so the Format step in .github/workflows/
# ci.yml was red on merge. `npm run format:write` is the worse half of the same
# hole: it rewrites the fixtures in place and turns golden.test.ts red.
#
# Why the fixtures must not be formatted at all: they are generator OUTPUT. The
# test renders with JSON.stringify(x, null, 2) and compares byte-for-byte, and
# Prettier's printWidth:100 collapses a short array onto one line -- a shape
# JSON.stringify can never emit. Measured: --write over the four fixtures
# rewrites golden.treat-nmd.json and golden.treat-nmd.local-only.json and takes
# golden.test.ts from 4 passed to 2 failed | 2 passed.
#
# The whole directory, not the two files that happen to fail today:
# golden.phenopacket.json and golden.fhir-r4.json pass only because neither
# currently holds an array short enough to collapse.
#
# format-ignore.test.ts drives prettier from both working directories and fails
# if either file stops covering the fixtures, so the duplication cannot drift.
src/modules/patient-profile/export/__fixtures__/golden.*.json
